Seraphim <gme6@cornell.edu> writes:
> I've managed to get myself into a rather tight bind, so I was wondering, 
> what hostile monsters will follow the player up stairs when he changes 
> level

<86k6xgzx9d.fsf@strackenz.spod-central.org>

> and what are the requirements for them to do so?

A hostile monster following you requires that it not have the Amulet;
that it not be fleeing, unless you have the Amulet; and that it not be
asleep, paralysed, or meditating. (It also has to be next to you, of
course.  As a digression, note that pet grid bugs won't follow you if
they're at a diagonal to you, since they have different adjacency rules.)

